==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|incest|ous|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Pertaining to or engaging in [[incest]].
#: ''If you engaged in an '''incestuous''' relationship with a family member, that would make you an inbreeder.''
# Characterized by [[mutual]] [[relationship]]s that are [[intimate]] and [[exclusive]] to the [[detriment]] of [[outsider]]s.

